  "body": "> The term **provides a paint source** is used as defined in the _CSS Image Values and Replaced Content_ specification to define the interaction of certain HTML elements with the CSS 'element()' function. [[CSSIMAGES](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-images/)]\n\nThe CSSIMAGES spec doesn't mention the words \"paint source\" anywhere, much less \"provides a paint source\".\n",
